{"title":"Asimov Press has a new kind of book","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/910336544/0/marginalrevolution~Asimov-Press-has-a-new-kind-of-book.html","date":1735852078000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Today we launched our second Asimov Press book…The book’s theme is “technology,” and so we encoded a complete copy of the book into DNA, <i>and are making </i>those DNA copies available to consumers for the first time.</p>\r\n<p>We worked with three companies (CATALOG, Plasmidsaurus, and Imagene) to make 1,000 copies of the DNA and package them into stainless steel capsules under an inert atmosphere, thus preserving the nucleotides for tens of thousands of years.</p>\r\n<p>Announcement: <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://secure-web.cisco.com/1jwn1UHuwptXgPUydhzWLM7OVGUuMLwputqoEX1aD1qpkQ30ipGZxDa9IDv3JhwKazJPjXfveMR2CqiizMxxHbSAVgddsVeQK-KSrXfxYJ6U8vgqYcMMnSRaw6E_0gogPxB8yhOOLEZaVm4wnqDUnpxn45MYa1w29Dh6r3-jqrjMeyT8Bje9RUR6YHG4jpZGFNvovPVysq5hNhYAeYbcczrHu-BauZKLKWNRGG8JETpmebS389mD2ks7asdgFI3mpZXM6QfylSPLao3h1NBcn3_Rw-hu4rGAje6wOR4r8DrEDf_a01288BrOaZ-5-Z4AXDHKYi1RlNSdv5b-L9P8R-AcEQe16VHsuRHMHpLxBD8t_nmBVL0rU1CaTREtwzFDQ1vr2iVAwbWdc5QkWVq6GV5nSqT-lXWj7HNJtAGGFscU/https%3A%2F%2Fwww.asimov.press%2Fp%2Ftechnology-book\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.asimov.press/p/technology-book</a></p>\r\n<p>X: <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FNikoMcCarty%2Fstatus%2F1874859187676852636&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7Cb29629b7384149f4e8ae08dd2b4f8234%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638714342661442124%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=mXgySyFaCtqIQ9snh%2BBJNwO58XQy5ijRHJYpoT1y6ZU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/NikoMcCarty/status/1874859187676852636</a></p>\r\n<p>Website: <a href=\"https://feeds.feed